                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The inflation rate reported in the news - CPI all items, compared with the same month a year earlier - fell from a median 22.34% in February 2025 to 15.36% in April 2026, though not in a straight line. Over those same months the median diesel price rose 70.49%, and from its low point in September 2025 to May 2026 diesel rose 158.16%. In the four months where fares and inflation can be compared year on year, okada fares rose a median 50.66% and intracity bus fares 39.37%, against inflation of 16.23%. This is about those measured costs, not about everything a business buys.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "color": "#1B1B1B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
